              "toImprove": [
                {
                  "text": "Confused or misstated some modalities/features, especially at first (e.g., reference to 'game modalities', unclear initial explanation of deal formats).",
                  "status": "warning",
                  "correction": "Say: 'We offer three main deal types: instant bill-wide discounts, pre-purchase vouchers (available for future redemption), and flash deals to spotlight specific items or times. Happy to explain which best suits your goals.'",
                  "_id": {
                    "$oid": "699bcb9d862f889f1237e988"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": "Provided inconsistent or factually incorrect information on funding support for discounts – first stated 15% merchant and 15% Grab co-funding, then corrects to 5% Grab co-funding for first 3 months.",
                  "status": "error",
                  "correction": "Say: 'Grab provides 5% co-funding support for your deals during the first three months. Typically, you fund the bulk of the discount and Grab subsidizes up to 5%, making it more attractive to diners at a lower cost to you.'",
                  "_id": {
                    "$oid": "699bcb9d862f889f1237e989"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": "Described the commission structure inaccurately in some responses; e.g., commission as 6% for instant deals, then mentioned 6.5% for flash deals (actual Dineout Deals commission is 6% regardless of deal type as per product info).",
                  "status": "error",
                  "correction": "Say: 'For all Dineout Deals modalities, Grab charges a simple 6% commission on the post-discount final bill value, with no upfront costs.'",
                  "_id": {
                    "$oid": "699bcb9d862f889f1237e98a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": "Did not leverage the unified customer data dashboard, AI recommendations, or targeted marketing tools that are unique to Grab and could create more value for Sandy.",
                  "status": "warning",
                  "correction": "Say: 'In addition to campaigns, Grab’s unique data integration gives you a unified dashboard of both online and dine-in guests—helping you tailor promos and menu updates, and send targeted WhatsApp messages to drive repeat business.'",
                  "_id": {
                    "$oid": "699bcb9d862f889f1237e98b"
                  }
                }
              ],
