              }
            },
            {
              "title": "Competitor Differentiation",
              "score": 33,
              "maxScore": 50,
              "strengths": [
                "Outlined how Grab offers a unified ecosystem across delivery, in-store traffic, and operational tools.",
                "Highlighted campaign reach, pay-for-performance approach, and downstream benefits like possible delivery commission incentives."
              ],
              "toImprove": [
                {
                  "text": "Failed to clearly articulate Grab’s unique value as the only platform capturing both online and offline customer data, which is a core differentiator.",
                  "status": "warning",
                  "correction": "Say: 'Grab uniquely offers a unified ecosystem, letting you see and market to both delivery and dine-in guests in one dashboard—no other platform supports such a holistic growth flywheel.'",
                  "_id": {
                    "$oid": "699bcb9d862f889f1237e98d"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": "Missed opportunity to reinforce how each Grab sub-product creates a 'flywheel' where data and customer reach in one area boosts performance in others.",
